  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Effective, Responsive and Inclusive Governance in Bangladesh (PERI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To mobilise several issue-based coalitions for change to improve service delivery, accountability on the targeted issues (e.g., labour migration exploitation), and promotion of women&apos;s and youth&apos;s leadership in politics, the project will support Civil Society Organisations, media and political actors. Following an adaptive approach, a consortium led by international organisations and other local Non-Governmental Organisations will implement the project.</narrative>
  </description>
